#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/modules/chat.md:1 messages/po4a/en.xml:445 messages/po4a/en.xml:450
#: messages/po4a/en.xml:728
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title #
#: docs/modules/chat.md:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat — 离线发送与多端冲突"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:8
msgid ""
"Chat SPA 支持 **离线写入 outbox**、上线后 **自动重试**，并通过 Habitat 侧幂等"
"与 tail CAS 避免重复发送与陈旧消息。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/chat.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "用户未读"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:12
msgid ""
"Chat 维护 **用户已读水位**（`conversation_read_state`，按 Habitat user "
"subject）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:17
msgid "会话未读：存在 `role=assistant` 且 `pos > last_read_pos` 的消息。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:17
msgid ""
"`conversation.list` 返回 `unread`；`conversation.unreadCount` 返回未归档未读"
"会话数（Shell 角标）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:17
msgid ""
"打开会话或正在查看时流式结束后调用 `conversation.markRead`（水位单调升高）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:17
msgid ""
"`conversation.subscribeInbox`（WS）在任意会话更新时推送 "
"`conversation.updated`，供列表与角标刷新。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:19
msgid "用户自己发送的消息不构成未读；不做 agent 未读分区。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/chat.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "客户端"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:27
msgid ""
"发送先入 IndexedDB `outbox`（`moduleId: chat`），并乐观显示 user bubble"
"（`sendStatus: pending`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:27
msgid "离线时可输入并发送；消息排队，Habitat 恢复后按 FIFO 重试。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:27
msgid ""
"**流式生成中**仍可输入并发送：消息入内存队列（不经 Habitat），当前 turn 结束"
"后按 FIFO 自动发出。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:27
msgid "重试前调用 `conversation.tail` 对比入队时的 `expected_tail_pos`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:27
msgid ""
"**tail 不一致**（会话已在别端继续）：标记 `stale`，默认不发送；用户可 **丢弃"
"** 或 **仍要发送**（`force_tail`）。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/chat.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Habitat 协议"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:31
msgid "`message.send` 可选字段："
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| 字段                | 说明                                 |\n"
"| ------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `client_op_id`      | 幂等键；重复请求不重复写入 user 消息 |\n"
"| `expected_tail_pos` | 发送时观测的 `max(pos)`，空会话为 0  |\n"
"| `force_tail`        | 跳过 CAS，追加到当前末尾             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:39
msgid "`conversation.tail` 返回 `{ tail_pos, tail_role?, updated_at? }`。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:41
msgid "流错误 `code`："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:43
msgid "`tail_conflict` — CAS 失败"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:45
msgid "幂等短路（`client_op_id` 已提供时）："
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:48
msgid ""
"turn **已完成**（该 user 后已有非空 assistant）→ 直接 `accepted` + `done`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/chat.md:48
msgid ""
"turn **进行中**（同 `client_op_id` 已占用）→ 直接 `accepted` + `done`，**不 "
"preempt / 不重跑**（避免弱网下在线发送与 outbox flush 并发触发两轮）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:50
msgid ""
"客户端：在线 `dispatchSend` 期间对 outbox op 做进程内 claim，flush preflight "
"跳过已 claim 的条目；`flushOfflineModule` 与全局 sync 共用锁。"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/chat.md:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "与离线平台（Stream outbox）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/chat.md:53
msgid ""
"Outbox 布局与 [`shell-sdk/offline-outbox`](../../src/frontend/shell-sdk/"
"offline-outbox.ts) 对齐；Chat flush 走 WS 流式 `message.send`，非通用 "
"Habitat RPC 单次响应。"
msgstr ""
